Acceptance criteria:
Every DS face cap and recessed socket clears the actual beveled touchscreen
border and stays inside the deck. The D-pad also clears the border. Preserve
cap sizes, diamond spacing, LCD size, materials, lights, projected anchors
and rendering quality. In both scene and runtime keyboard focus, A and S
deliver only native DS Y and X press/release; Q and W retain DS L and R.
GBA keyboard defaults and saved remapping remain unchanged. Preserve all
native assertions, original deadlines, retries0 and the complete deployment
gate. Separate implementation, local verification, acceptance and publication.

